  "FINAL_rule" [label="(0,0,0) Rule: If comprehensive multi-model proteomics with human comparison is needed, and protein turnover measurements explain inconsistencies, then the complete research approach should integrate deep proteomics, phosphoproteomics, multiple AD models, age-dependent analysis, human-mouse comparison, and protein turnover measurements"];
